@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

package "Web Application" {
    RECTANGLE Frontend {
        + React Components
        + State Management
        + API Client
    }
    
    RECTANGLE Backend {
        + REST API
        + Business Logic
        + Authentication
    }
    
    RECTANGLE Database {
        + PostgreSQL
        + Redis Cache
    }
}

Frontend --> Backend : HTTP/REST
Backend --> Database : SQL Queries
Backend --> Database : Cache Operations

note right of Frontend
    Modern SPA built with React
    Handles user interactions
end note

note right of Backend
    Node.js/Express API
    Handles business logic
end note

note right of Database
    Persistent storage
    and caching layer
end note
@enduml
